{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/obq90bml","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":89.42,"top":163.47,"width":1095.49,"height":428.38},"name":"Text 4","text":"ARCHITECTURE\nRole portals → Express API (JWT, matching, alerts) → PostgreSQL\nRender hosting  •  Leaflet + OpenStreetMap\n\nIBM BOB — DEVELOPMENT PARTNER\nDesign: Co-designed five core interfaces and safety-first redistribution.\nBuild: Web interfaces, Express backend, role access, matching, and alerts.\nTest: Helped debug and validate; 33/33 end-to-end tests passed.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":21.33,"typeface":"IBM Plex Sans","color":"#0072CE","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
